{"strongs": "H3209", "word": "יִלּוֺד", "translit": "yil.lod", "root": "ילוד", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "born", "definition": "יִלּוֺד adjective born (irregular punctuation for יָלוּד , Dr 2Sam 5:14 ) — יִלּוֺד Exod 1:22 ; 2Sam 12:14 יִלֹּדִים Josh 5:5 ; 2Sam 5:14 יִלּוֺדִים Jer 16:3 ׳ הַבֵּן הַיִּלּ Exod 1:22 ( E ), 2Sam 12:14 (+ לְךָ ); בַּמִּדְבָּר ׳ הָעָם הַיִּלּ Josh 5:5 ( D ); עַלהַֿבָּנִים וְעַלהַֿבָּנוֺת הַיִּלּוֺדִים בַּמָּקוֺם הַזֶּה Jer 16:3 הַיִּלּוֺדִים לוֺ 2Sam 5:14 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3547')\">BDB3547</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3209')\">H3209</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3546')\">BDB3546</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3548')\">BDB3548</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יִלּוֺד</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>born</highlightword> (irregular punctuation for <bdbheb>יָלוּד</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,14)\">2Sam 5:14</ref>) — <bdbheb>יִלּוֺד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 1:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,22)\">Exod 1:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,14)\">2Sam 12:14</ref> <bdbheb>יִלֹּדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 5:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,5)\">Josh 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,14)\">2Sam 5:14</ref> <bdbheb>יִלּוֺדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 16:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,3)\">Jer 16:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַבֵּן הַיִּלּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 1:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,22)\">Exod 1:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>